me":"text-xl font-bold text-arbiter-dark mb-3","children":"What Is Project Transparency?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The word transparency can be defined as \"the quality of being done in an open way without secrets.\" In the realm of projects and processes, it means managing a project in which all team members can access all relevant information easily and efficiently."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":"In the project world it means that employees have easy and quick access to project documentation and information necessary to complete their tasks. At the same time, leads have an accurate and real-time understanding of the work completion status within the project. For that reason project transparency leads to better outcomes for both the team and the project itself."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-arbiter-gray-bg border border-arbiter-border rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-sm font-bold text-arbiter-dark","children":"A project becomes transparent when:"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-sm text-arbiter-muted","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green"}]}],"Teams can easily access and work with project data, no matter where they are located or when they try to access it."]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-sm text-arbiter-muted","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green"}]}],"There is assurance that data is accurate and provided by the official source."]}]]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-bold text-arbiter-dark mb-4","children":"Transparency has a positive impact on a project through:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3","children":[["$","div","Improved understanding of the project",{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-arbiter-green/5 border border-arbiter-green/15 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-arbiter-dark font-medium","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex-shrink-0"}],"Improved understanding of the project"]}],["$","div","Enhanced team productivity",{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-arbiter-green/5 border border-arbiter-green/15 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-arbiter-dark font-medium","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex-shrink-0"}],"Enhanced team productivity"]}],["$","div","Increased accountability",{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-arbiter-green/5 border border-arbiter-green/15 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-arbiter-dark font-medium","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex-shrink-0"}],"Increased accountability"]}],["$","div","Smooth communications",{"className":"flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-arbiter-green/5 border border-arbiter-green/15 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-arbiter-dark font-medium","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex-shrink-0"}],"Smooth communications"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/8]","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80","alt":"Team accessing project information","className":"w-full h-full object-cover"}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0","children":"1"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-arbiter-dark","children":"Having project-related information at your fingertips saves time."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"When it comes to pushing projects forward and making progress, all team members must have access to the information they need to effectively complete tasks."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":"For instance, if team members uncover an issue and need project-related information for guidance, good project transparency will ensure they have this information at their fingertips. The last thing you want is for these team members to start contacting other employees in search of the relevant information needed to successfully complete their tasks."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 bg-arbiter-gray-bg border border-arbiter-border rounded-xl p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-arbiter-dark mb-1","children":"The solution"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-arbiter-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A centralized digital system to store information relevant to a project. With everything in one place, team members can quickly access information without slowing down their workflows or disrupting others. A project completions platform can store all project-related documentation and assign it to specific objects or systems."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/8]","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557804506-669a67965ba0?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80","alt":"Digital files and documents","className":"w-full h-full object-cover"}]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0","children":"2"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-arbiter-dark","children":"Having access to the necessary information simplifies the workflow."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Project transparency means sharing project data between team members through facilitating information flow distribution across all management levels throughout the project lifecycle."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":"A team member that does not have properly organized access to project documents will find it challenging to get the information they need. For instance, if an electrician is in search of a specific wiring diagram, it will take considerable time going through all wiring diagrams of the project to find exactly the one needed."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 bg-arbiter-gray-bg border border-arbiter-border rounded-xl p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-arbiter-dark mb-1","children":"The solution"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-arbiter-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A project completion platform that not only stores project-related documentation, but assigns this documentation to be accessible exactly where and when it is needed. That way team members can access all relevant documentation when doing their checks or tasks, with a simple click of a button, and will only get information that is relevant to them at that given moment."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-arbiter-green flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm flex-shrink-0","children":"3"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-arbiter-dark","children":"Project transparency allows your leads to easily access real-time project statuses and reports."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Successful projects are always a result of good planning, scheduling, and reporting. And it is hard to do one without another."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":"If your company cannot track its project progress due to inaccurate reporting, your leads will have a hard time planning the next project stage. Without accurate planning, the scheduling of teams, employees, and resources will not be accurate, creating delays and overruns, especially when project deficiencies have to be taken care of."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-5 bg-arbiter-gray-bg border border-arbiter-border rounded-xl p-5","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-arbiter-dark mb-1","children":"The solution"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-arbiter-muted leading-relaxed","children":"With a transparent project, your leads will always have their finger on the pulse of the project. They will know the exact project status and be able to plan and schedule ahead, minimizing the risk of delays. A project completions platform offers real-time project progress available to anyone in the organization, anywhere in the world. Upon work completion, the platform automatically updates the information in the system."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/8]","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504868584819-f8e8b4b6d7e3?w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80","alt":"Project reporting dashboard","className":"w-full h-full object-cover"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-arbiter-gray-bg border border-arbiter-border rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-4 justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-bold text-arbiter-dark text-sm mb-1","children":"Build transparency into your next project"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-arbiter-muted","children":"See how Arbiter gives every stakeholder a single source of truth."}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"/#contact","className":"flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-arbiter-green text-white text-sm font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-arbiter-green-dark transition-colors","children":"Schedule a Demo"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","footer"